Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Compute exact slice coverage and overlap using the approved population definitions. Interpret whether apparent balance masks duplicated sources or missing mechanisms, and identify the most consequential acquisition gaps rather than optimizing superficial counts.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
